    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:64f10c0ea07d97612d8eb668",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "严选食材的盛宴直击五官！",
      "source_fingerprint": "61175730535a271b95c26e9035dca21138e943da9f3a622c8cbd2b49ba6cdd54",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "464",
        "89"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:009894c8abd806ad233b757a",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "反复锤炼的拉面大受好评",
      "source_fingerprint": "45dbdef9cd08ca27a5239af5b291c97b9c337e8ada06b6a748c0d12d5c0db6bb",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "464",
        "9"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:55cfb7421e3ca898c25cf82a",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "色彩丰富的盐味究极和声",
      "source_fingerprint": "2b5e6054f2cf51873d3742189788e21df8b5b7d0154cd322ee0e5f78062ae4ce",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "464",
        "90"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:89de8bb53e137e34ef1f767d",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "感谢与修行之旅，堂堂完结！",
      "source_fingerprint": "ffaa749f2ff28426b0f22cdd0391e8d9088ed2d6191411e6d1b230e8e6a81de6",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "464",
        "91"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:fb441952b469360f6bc24450",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "用美味向全国传达感谢！",
      "source_fingerprint": "269406091329996a088cdc4b90db5ea9cb017fab2e7791dec8e21d04f494c0a4",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "464",
        "92"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:dd16c963e1b85ce923542060",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "积累了牵绊的一碗！",
      "source_fingerprint": "ebc77071c71d6e30be7ffae3ab458921f71a79a73526b988afb787da654e33df",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "464",
        "93"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f2d130b1e1d1c306d470dde5",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "伴随各地的盛况迈向尾声！",
      "source_fingerprint": "168b6b0883ce281178741ae1cc5042eef6d4db7fa9c6ceecd6e77fb6afea4c4f",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "464",
        "94"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:97330f6b9eef4e3f8bf5b178",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "以史上最大的动员人数顺利跑完全程！",
      "source_fingerprint": "ee5c4e334e98bee0408f9bf0781163b58bbcb718c68cfe7c165768c0bffb06bd",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "464",
        "95"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6ac30dcda9a955f6b3c259fb",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "赛马娘们带来的感谢活动，拉面嘉年华首次举办！",
      "source_fingerprint": "bc935254284a08645f4676a14360cafd32333b27fc9e6a40ae2a45c936197a67",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "464",
        "96"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a904e1368f2f5b3d7ae89e06",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "赛马娘们的全新挑战，拉面嘉年华开始了！",
      "source_fingerprint": "15cd6cc022ca3159cf281f39034cf8ae3f008e9e2c955d142085a8f6c02c6dca",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "464",
        "97"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1f1c815420bc6e21d0034752",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "全国规模的大型活动，拉面嘉年华启动了！",
      "source_fingerprint": "3df54fc0c2af050fde316d84dccecfacb685f4efff81a5c61b51e32d1233a066",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "464",
        "98"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:54892e4efdd115ed7b8ec71c",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "在拉面嘉年华中，特雷森轩于<region_name>赛场开店！",
      "source_fingerprint": "abd58aabc0fe277cc920b70ac10de206e8e7f0941db05963a1193e4c3115c768",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "464",
        "99"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:aeea5c987bad05b2766cd67f",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "面的诀窍",
      "source_fingerprint": "e8d45c65a6c04aec26b95d2189ba94aff2ab788f4649423ac88c062c6112c6b6",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "465",
        "1"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f09d68720a6c50c4bcb149b4",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "汤底的诀窍",
      "source_fingerprint": "b0b7bf726e133df96daceed5505e812e6779e258528892b8267a8a7a061a8501",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "465",
        "2"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a8601f950866fd04e2e2d7b4",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "配料的诀窍",
      "source_fingerprint": "9e887791351502cba3c73cc3cf6b12c2586aa4331e52e53ce108501c77958683",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "465",
        "3"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:616bb107ab666c2cb8ce747c",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "连续出战",
      "source_fingerprint": "dd542f3f4b8ad9d177a93dc2ff140ec9668a3b24ad2984dbce16faf8a77bc207",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "467",
        "1"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:67cd18a4a53ac302876b0e31",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "场地资质",
      "source_fingerprint": "5fb80203b01784aa8fd8c000a8f84e3a89c0fe188b2f2c4134fce6b6ab6252d6",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "467",
        "2"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b81ec1dbe4d15e2da4d29ada",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "距离资质",
      "source_fingerprint": "8f54aa8dad5c5b148beb45f8fdd6f796980b7fd058beacf91075e2622543d944",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "467",
        "3"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e87554454587786a53b198d1",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "连续出战似乎积累了疲劳呢\\n看来最好重新规划一下出战安排",
      "source_fingerprint": "43f6a499b009669f0f52d17d8847844c6f929558def03d167ed41b9335d93cd3",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "468",
        "1"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0ef005f56f0b25e1880e4dbe",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "场地资质不合，似乎没能发挥出全部能力呢\\n为了契合资质，重新规划一下出战安排吧",
      "source_fingerprint": "6cd1496546ccd759b9daebb0fd3b5111106984a26f39fabd1ee1dcc816d5da5c",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "468",
        "2"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:bd4f1f9b38ffb5f542536c2f",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "距离资质不合，似乎没能发挥出全部能力呢\\n为了契合资质，重新规划一下出战安排吧",
      "source_fingerprint": "866c3ed1dd6cf2fc9a880c9eb8aac0927f66615b2bb108cfd920cab4210d772d",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "468",
        "3"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1bb47cebc737ca4d7003a364",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "训练员！自主训练结束了！\\n我非常努力哦，请您务必来看看成果！",
      "source_fingerprint": "13a20e0253cf1498a545220d154ab3f66f7867055cdea8a71acc21310666137e",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "469",
        "1001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8eb533add25379089f581c5b",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "自主训练结束了。……在训练员\\n到来之前，我会边跑边等您的。",
      "source_fingerprint": "b1d690b26ef6b154f16eff8784dcab025056baec8aaec6482af2415ccf04e17a",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "469",
        "1002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:24d7fe50a6c425cabf91efa9",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "喂——训练员！自主训练结束了哦！\\n再不快点来的话，我可就去找会长了哦！",
      "source_fingerprint": "6311e2b4a4fa26954f9799c67bfb79771a7197079bc9a7f4e4832a49e6c215b0",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "469",
        "1003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1728328916b9f87f947d9d92",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "自主训练完毕。状态超级棒哦♪\\n姐姐我时髦又青春的跑姿，不来看看吗？",
      "source_fingerprint": "97ad9f5c51801d1ee0afc593591bfaec7f540a5ea2fc1028645c2a763cdf6f3c",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "469",
        "1004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d645e2cf5ae561965dd094ef",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "除了自主训练的成果，我还得准备\\n特别的惊喜才行呢。那么，做好大吃一惊的准备了吗？",
      "source_fingerprint": "87a4d039addf7cd86f7f0629a7cef28243012ce28fe257f27daf1f9945d727b7",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "469",
        "1005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:cbf23c29623e03a9bd2c8cbf",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "自主训练结束了。关于训练内容我有些事想找你\\n商量……不过在此之前，我想先和你一起吃个饭。",
      "source_fingerprint": "2f395423ec39f9862cea189b11e5916cc5277e9382ea60b61ec5facc8ed31194",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "469",
        "1006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:69392ecc7385661db9525eb0",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "来一决胜负吧。是你先夸奖我的自主训练呢，\\n还是我先用青口贝色把整个学园涂满呢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "a507968189706685829b015437ece7edef3e7f52342100efda229acb1c1fb3c7",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "469",
        "1007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:93384f420b4bc3ce84c38e64",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "呼——，大功告成了……我构思的最强自主训练！\\n来吧搭档！看着这惊人的成果大吃一惊吧～！",
      "source_fingerprint": "e081f6be2dca6f71ef0c36f967c81217d021d81826b434055927d5200d64983e",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "469",
        "1008"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:dddb524a78fc9d713df8f752",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "真是的，等你的时候我都把自主训练做完了哦？\\n要是再让我等下去，我可饶不了你！",
      "source_fingerprint": "a8b468f6d23403c7e5c5c33437b788a30662f7ba353381deafce083689f4e69b",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "469",
        "1009"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:23d02bf72401f37095f1c771",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "自主训练是结束了……但拥抱不够啊！\\n呜……训练员，请快点回来吧～！",
      "source_fingerprint": "23fe95ef03447a9b7108849314afe2455f1aaa3f74c4fe1d2b530d1e2036ea98",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "469",
        "1010"
      ]
    }
  ]
}
